'''''Plagiothecium undulatum''''' (vernacular name: '''Wavy-leaved cotton moss'''{{citation needed|date=February 2021}}) is a species of [[moss]] belonging to the family [[Plagiotheciaceae]].<ref name="GBIF">{{cite web |title=Plagiothecium undulatum (Hedw.) Schimp. |url=https://www.gbif.org/species/5710930 |website=www.gbif.org |access-date=12 February 2021 |language=en}}</ref>

It has a [[cosmopolitan distribution]].<ref name="GBIF" />

